<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Georgios M - 120,000 tonnes coal Dalrymple/Port Talbot $8.90 fio six days shinc mid July British Steel.</p>
<p>Primo - 110,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Redcar $6.05 fio six days shinc early July British Steel.</p>
<p>ORE - Pan Ocean TBN - 140,000-200,000 tonnes ore Port Cartier and Seven Islands/two ports S.Korea $11.25 fio 26/7-9/8 Posco.</p>
<p>Leon - 140,000 tonnes ore option of second cargo Saldanha Bay/Beilun $7.50 fio scale load/30,000 shinc July Great Chance (amended).</p>
</text>
